 "_swall23_status_open": "WorldUpgrader.status (class_1257.field_5765) is wired for reads only: 26.1 computes the shown status from UpgradeProgress (UpgradeStatusTranslator), so a written component would reach nothing 26.1 shows; the aw-put row stays open (needs a getStatus hook, not done)",
 "_swall23_client_basis": "GameRenderer fovModifier/oldFovModifier -> Camera (tickFov same body), lastActiveTime -> Minecraft.lastActiveTime (same stamp/500ms test), renderDistance read-only (1.21.11 reset it each frame to effective render distance*16; its aw-put row stays open), LevelRenderer captureFrustum/capturedFrustum -> Camera, EditBox/MultiLineEditBox cursor constants -> TextCursorUtils values, EditBox.filter -> the layer's restored filter (CbWallEditBoxFilter). javap evidence in rt/CbWallClientFields."
